~ start
Iris Illepah: You walk like the Registry counts your steps. Stand easy. The grove does not bill for shade.
=> hub

~ hub
Iris Illepah: Ask, then. The light is long and the sweeping is done.
- "The Bloom isn't finished, is it?" [#tag=SSAE-SEEDERS] [#consequence=The groves will know your name.]
	do Reputation.record("player", "ssae-seeders", 8.0, "Spoke of the Bloom as unfinished", "field")
	Iris Illepah: No. It is still deciding what it grows. We only argue about whether to help it decide.
	=> hub
- "This grove is unregistered. That will be recorded." [#tag=REGISTRY] [#consequence=The Ledger will hold your name.]
	do Reputation.record("player", "ssae-seeders", -6.0, "Threatened the grove with a Registry writ", "field")
	do Reputation.record("player", "the-registry", 4.0, "Reported an unregistered grove", "field")
	do Renown.gain_infamy("player", 5.0, "Threatened a grove-tender with the Registry's writ", "field")
	Iris Illepah: Then record it. The Loam keeps a longer ledger than Rennen, and it forgives less.
	=> hub
- "Show me what the Loam remembers." [#tag=COMMUNION] [#cost=-6 soul] [#consequence=Some of you stays in the Loam.]
	do GameState.set_soul_meter(GameState.soul_meter - 6.0)
	do Reputation.record("player", "ssae-seeders", 3.0, "Opened a vein to the Loam and did not flinch", "field")
	Iris Illepah: Put your hand under the moss. There. Everything returns, and lately it returns hungry. The Loam is hungry and cannot eat.
	Iris Illepah: You felt it take its fee. The needle on your little dial is honest. That is the problem with it.
	=> hub
- "Teach me the Seeders' rite." [#tag=SSAE-SEEDERS] [#consequence=There is no returning from knowing this.] [if Reputation.standing("ssae-seeders") >= 15.0 /]
	Iris Illepah: Not here. Come to the overhang in the Zwarten Bos when the Green Pulse sounds. Bring bread. He eats it out of politeness.
	=> END
- "Is there work I could do for the grove?" [#tag=SSAE-SEEDERS] [if not QuestRegistry.is_active(QuestRegistry.LOAMROOT_SPRIGS) and not QuestRegistry.is_done(QuestRegistry.LOAMROOT_SPRIGS) /]
	do QuestRegistry.offer(QuestRegistry.LOAMROOT_SPRIGS)
	Iris Illepah: Three loamroot sprigs have rooted wrong, out past the treeline. Bring them here before they take hold proper.
	=> hub
- "Still gathering the loamroot sprigs." [if QuestRegistry.is_active(QuestRegistry.LOAMROOT_SPRIGS) and not QuestRegistry.LOAMROOT_SPRIGS.objective_completed /]
	Iris Illepah: Take your time. They do not rot, only wait.
	=> hub
- "I brought the loamroot sprigs. Put them back where they belong." [#tag=SSAE-SEEDERS] [#consequence=Brought the Loam what it asked for.] [if QuestRegistry.is_active(QuestRegistry.LOAMROOT_SPRIGS) and QuestRegistry.LOAMROOT_SPRIGS.objective_completed /]
	do QuestRegistry.turn_in(QuestRegistry.LOAMROOT_SPRIGS, "returned", true)
	do Renown.gain_reputation("player", 5.0, "Returned lost loamroot sprigs to the grove", "field")
	Iris Illepah: Good hands. The grove will remember these came back to it, not just away from it.
	=> hub
- "Use my pattern to root them. I can bear the cost." [#tag=COMMUNION] [#cost=-8 soul] [#consequence=The grove is anchored with a thread of your soul.] [if QuestRegistry.is_active(QuestRegistry.LOAMROOT_SPRIGS) and QuestRegistry.LOAMROOT_SPRIGS.objective_completed and GameState.soul_meter >= 8.0 /]
	do GameState.set_soul_meter(GameState.soul_meter - 8.0)
	do QuestRegistry.turn_in(QuestRegistry.LOAMROOT_SPRIGS, "communion", true)
	do Reputation.record("player", "ssae-seeders", 5.0, "Anchored the wrong-rooted sprigs with their own soul", "field")
	do Renown.gain_reputation("player", 8.0, "Spent soul to return the loamroot sprigs alive", "field")
	Iris Illepah: Easy. Do not pull away when they know your name. There — three roots held, and one soul a little less certain of its edges.
	=> hub
- "The Registry will take custody of these specimens." [#tag=REGISTRY] [#consequence=The grove's sickness enters a numbered drawer.] [if QuestRegistry.is_active(QuestRegistry.LOAMROOT_SPRIGS) and QuestRegistry.LOAMROOT_SPRIGS.objective_completed /]
	do QuestRegistry.turn_in(QuestRegistry.LOAMROOT_SPRIGS, "registry", false)
	do Reputation.record("player", "ssae-seeders", -8.0, "Seized wrong-rooted sprigs from the grove", "field")
	do Reputation.record("player", "the-registry", 8.0, "Delivered living Loam specimens for classification", "field")
	do Renown.gain_infamy("player", 4.0, "Took living Loam specimens under a Registry claim", "field")
	Iris Illepah: Custody. A clean word for a locked drawer. Take them, then. When the drawer begins to root, tell your clerks I warned them.
	=> hub
- "I should go."
	Iris Illepah: Go, then. Keep off the new moss. It is younger than it looks, and it remembers feet.
	=> END
